# Every lab login ({{ pelab_domain }})

Generated by pe-lab-ansible. Keep this file private: it holds every delegate's
password. Instructor and admin logins are in `platform.md`.

{% if pelab_shared_logins | bool %}
Delegates may sign in as their teammates and as `{{ pelab_platform_approver_user }}`
(`pelab_shared_logins: true`): each access sheet and each workspace's
`/etc/pelab/logins.md` lists their team's logins.
{% else %}
Each delegate's access sheet lists only their own login (`pelab_shared_logins: false`).
{% endif %}

